                                "sense_id": "b2a44838-ecc3-31e5-bfb8-5e5678408e82",
                                "text": "With symphonies soft and sweet colour\nIt courted me then,\nTill evasions seemed wrong,\nTill evasions gave in to its song,\nAnd I warmed, until living aloofly loomed duller\nThan life among men."
                            },
